fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266DUInfo","fragment":"\n\tGstH266DUInfo\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266DUInfo\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266DUInfo\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 decoding unit info.\nspecifies the index to the list of DUs in the current AU.\nspecifies whether\ndui_du_cpb_removal_delay_increment[i] is present for the sublayer.\nspecifies the duration between the nominal\nCPB times of the last DU in decoding order in the current AU.\nspecifies the presence of the\ndui_dpb_output_du_delay syntax element in the DUI SEI message.\nis used to compute the DPB output time of the AU.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 decoding unit info.\nspecifies the index to the list of DUs in the current AU.\nspecifies whether\ndui_du_cpb_removal_delay_increment[i] is present for the sublayer.\nspecifies the duration between the nominal\nCPB times of the last DU in decoding order in the current AU.\nspecifies the presence of the\ndui_dpb_output_du_delay syntax element in the DUI SEI message.\nis used to compute the DPB output time of the AU.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 decoding unit info.\nspecifies the index to the list of DUs in the current AU.\nspecifies whether\ndui_du_cpb_removal_delay_increment[i] is present for the sublayer.\nspecifies the duration between the nominal\nCPB times of the last DU in decoding order in the current AU.\nspecifies the presence of the\ndui_dpb_output_du_delay syntax element in the DUI SEI message.\nis used to compute the DPB output time of the AU.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});